{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Sprint</strong> is a fast-paced 3D endless runner packed with action, challenge, and style!<br>Dash through vibrant worlds \u2014 from scorching deserts to bustling cities and soaring skies \u2014 as you dodge obstacles, collect coins, and chase your next high score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six unique levels</strong> with increasing difficulty \u2014 from relaxing runs to intense sprints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five powerful upgrades</strong> to boost your run:<br>\ud83e\ude99 <i>Double Coins</i> \u2013 Earn twice as much with every pickup.<br>\u23f3 <i>Slow Motion</i> \u2013 Bend time to dodge tricky obstacles.<br>\ud83e\uddf2 <i>Coin Magnet</i> \u2013 Pull in coins from all around you.<br>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <i>Invincibility</i> \u2013 Stay safe from all obstacles for a limited time.<br>\u2764\ufe0f <i>Revive</i> \u2013 Get back in the race after a fall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable levels, characters, and pets</strong> \u2014 </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pets automatically collect coins as you run!</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-game shop</strong> \u2014 purchase new characters and pets with coins earned through gameplay (no real money required).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local leaderboards</strong> \u2014 track your personal bests and challenge your friends to beat your scores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements</strong> \u2014 complete challenges and earn stars to show off your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth controls</strong> \u2014 jump, slide, and sprint to avoid obstacles and keep your run alive.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re after a casual experience or a skill-based challenge, <strong>World Sprint</strong> offers endless replay ability. Perfect your timing, unlock everything, and see how long you can last!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you conquer every challenge and become the ultimate sprinter?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4121040?t=1761786053","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4121040?t=1761786053","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121040/2ed7465c96d8cdedcfe21c1bf8e2b2786402b0f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761786053","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121040/2ed7465c96d8cdedcfe21c1bf8e2b2786402b0f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761786053","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Sprint</strong> is a fast-paced 3D endless runner packed with action, challenge, and style!<br>Dash through vibrant worlds \u2014 from scorching deserts to bustling cities and soaring skies \u2014 as you dodge obstacles, collect coins, and chase your next high score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six unique levels</strong> with increasing difficulty \u2014 from relaxing runs to intense sprints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five powerful upgrades</strong> to boost your run:<br>\ud83e\ude99 <i>Double Coins</i> \u2013 Earn twice as much with every pickup.<br>\u23f3 <i>Slow Motion</i> \u2013 Bend time to dodge tricky obstacles.<br>\ud83e\uddf2 <i>Coin Magnet</i> \u2013 Pull in coins from all around you.<br>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <i>Invincibility</i> \u2013 Stay safe from all obstacles for a limited time.<br>\u2764\ufe0f <i>Revive</i> \u2013 Get back in the race after a fall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable levels, characters, and pets</strong> \u2014 </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pets automatically collect coins as you run!</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-game shop</strong> \u2014 purchase new characters and pets with coins earned through gameplay (no real money required).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local leaderboards</strong> \u2014 track your personal bests and challenge your friends to beat your scores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements</strong> \u2014 complete challenges and earn stars to show off your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth controls</strong> \u2014 jump, slide, and sprint to avoid obstacles and keep your run alive.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re after a casual experience or a skill-based challenge, <strong>World Sprint</strong> offers endless replay ability. Perfect your timing, unlock everything, and see how long you can last!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you conquer every challenge and become the ultimate sprinter?</p>","developers":["AKD Studios LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121040/18a4470c66615ab28a38ac9212ac671c5fc8bf6c/header.jpg?t=1761786053","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul cla